### Smart Contact Form API Tests
@baseUrl = https://contact-form.public.hub.codenteam.click

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Fetch public client config (reCAPTCHA site key)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contact-config
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Submit contact (invalid recaptcha — expect verification failure)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/submit-contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "referrer": "https://docs.example.com/showcase/hello-world",
  "recaptchaToken": "invalid-token",
  "formPurpose": "docs-showcase:hello-world",
  "answers": {
    "name": "Jane Doe",
    "email": "jane@example.com",
    "company": "Acme Inc",
    "message": "Interested in automating workflows with Habits."
